@div proverb 21.c6

C.21.c6.21. %e gi₄#-in %s ud šu₂-šu₂-ru# ŋi₆ MAŠ-a-gin₇ an-na-di-di#-X
#lem: gin[worker]N; ud[sun]; šuš[cover]; ŋi[night]; n; ŋen[go]
