#lem: gin[worker]N; anba[litter]; pa[branch]; e[leave]; gašan[lady]N; X
#tr.en: @note{= Alster 1997 21 Sec. A 7; cf. @xref[t.6.1.19,t.6.1.19.d10]{6.1.19.d10}} The litter was not apparent to the slave girl. To her mistress ……. 
