#lem: X; gala[female genitals]; naŋgin[~worker]N; ga[carry]V/t
#tr.en: @note{= Alster 1997 21 Sec. A 13} If I ……, my vagina brings me slavery. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.21.c13.29

